  "retention": {
   "office_pano": "fully_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "New location: the property office at midday. The door bangs open, the heavy manager strides to the desk and slams his palm down on it, and the pale young colleague trails in behind him.",
  "shots": "New location, taken from the reference image: the office of 景宸大厦, door on the LEFT of frame, the venetian-blind window and tall wooden cabinets on the RIGHT, the dark wooden desk across the middle of the room. 苏小满 (S1) stands on the NEAR side of the desk with her back to the door, facing the far side. Warm midday light comes through the blinds in long bright bands.\n[Shot 1] Wide: the LEFT door is flung inward so hard that it rebounds off the wall; 钱经理 (S3) strides in without slowing, dark waistcoat, staff badge swinging, and 小唐 (S4) slips in behind him and presses her back to the wall just inside the door, lower-left of frame, face pale and eyes darting.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, medium: 钱经理 (S3) reaches the far side of the desk, plants both feet wide, leans forward on straight arms and slams his open palm flat onto the desktop; his open palm cracks flat against the bare desktop and the venetian blinds tick against the glass.\n[Shot 3] At 00:03.000, close on 钱经理's (S3) flushed face as he announces it in a loud nasal Mandarin, filing each item like a charge sheet: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.600, reverse over the desk onto 苏小满 (S1): she stands perfectly still on the near side of the desk, both hands loose at her sides, chin level, eyes on him. She says nothing and nobody else in the room speaks.",
  "soundscape": "The door crashing against the wall, heavy brisk footsteps on the tiled floor, the flat slap of a palm on wood, the blind slats settling, the buzz of the ceiling fluorescent panels, faint traffic through the blinds.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t15",
  "scene": "1-2",
  "title": "点名",
  "refs": [
   "qianjingli",
   "suxiaoman",
   "office_mid",
   "office_pano"
  ],
  "retention": {
   "office_mid": "partially_preserved",
   "office_pano": "fully_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "The manager narrows it down to one person, staring across the desk; she denies it flatly and without heat.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) is leaning on the far side of the desk with one palm flat on it, back to the window; 苏小满 (S1) stands on the NEAR side of the desk with her back to the door, facing him; 小唐 (S4) is against the wall just inside the LEFT door.\n[Shot 1] Medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing her with the look of a man who has already decided, and speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk, the blind-light barring the wall behind her; she does not move her feet and does not look away, and answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.800, wide two-shot across the desk, both of them motionless at either side of it, the room very still, 小唐 (S4) a small pale shape at the edge of frame with her mouth shut.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.200, the camera creeps a few centimetres closer on the desk surface between them. Neither of them speaks.",
  "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall, the low hum of the ceiling lights, one nervous swallow, faint corridor noise beyond the door.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t16",
  "scene": "1-2",
  "title": "小唐作证",
  "refs": [
   "xiaotang",
   "qianjingli",
   "suxiaoman",
   "office_mid"
  ],
  "retention": {
   "office_mid": "partially_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "Pressed from the wall, the young colleague gives a deliberately vague testimony, and the manager takes it as proof.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side of the desk facing the door; 苏小满 (S1) on the near side with her back to the door; 小唐 (S4) is still flattened against the wall just inside the LEFT door, lower-left of frame.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) turns his shoulder toward the door and jerks his chin at 小唐 (S4), summoning her forward without a word.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, closer on 小唐 (S4): she peels off the wall, folds her hands together, keeps her eyes on the floor tiles and lets them flick once toward 苏小满 (S1), then away; she speaks in a small thin nervous Mandarin, fast and slightly breathy: [Chinese] 钱经理。中午，我看见她往兜里塞东西。没看清。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.400, reverse onto 苏小满 (S1) across the desk: her shoulders stay level, only her eyes travel to the girl by the door.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.400, close on 钱经理 (S3) taking that in, the corner of his mouth pulling up. Nobody else speaks.",
  "soundscape": "A thin nervous voice close to the lens, the fluorescent panels buzzing, a chair creaking somewhere behind the door, one dry swallow.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t17",
  "scene": "1-2",
  "title": "看清楚了再说",
  "refs": [
   "suxiaoman",
   "xiaotang",
   "office_mid",
   "office_back"
  ],
  "retention": {
   "office_mid": "partially_preserved",
   "office_back": "weak_reference"
  },
  "summary": "The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; 小唐 (S4) has taken one step in from the wall, lower-left of frame; 钱经理 (S3) on the far side of the desk.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: the two women staged one behind the other along the room's depth axis — 小唐 (S4) nearer the door, 苏小满 (S1) nearer the desk — with 钱经理 (S3) motionless behind the desk, back to the window, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. Nobody moves and nobody speaks.",
  "soundscape": "Two quiet voices in a hard-surfaced room, a chair leg scraping, the wall clock ticking, muffled office noise from the corridor.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t18",
  "scene": "1-2",
  "title": "掏兜",
  "refs": [
   "qianjingli",
   "suxiaoman",
   "office_mid",
   "office_pano"
  ],
  "retention": {
   "office_mid": "partially_preserved",
   "office_pano": "fully_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "He orders her to empty her pockets, offering the alternative of security; she holds her ground and refuses to be searched.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) is stepping round the end of the desk onto the NEAR side and closing to one pace in front of 苏小满 (S1); 苏小满 (S1) is on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; 小唐 (S4) is by the door at the lower-left.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1): she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut. She is silent after that.",
  "soundscape": "Tense quiet, his knuckles tapping cloth, a shoe shifting on tile, the fluorescent hum, distant corridor chatter.",
  "music": "A low sustained synth note, tight and uneasy."
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t19",
