  "summary": "He converts her refusal into a confession, and the onlookers gather in the open doorway behind her.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) stands one pace in front of 苏小满 (S1) on the NEAR side of the desk; she is on the near side of the desk with her hand still closed over her pocket; 小唐 (S4) is by the LEFT door.\n[Shot 1] Close on 钱经理's (S3) face: he lets a slow smile spread, tips his head back a little and says it softly in a light jeering Mandarin, savouring the logic: [Chinese] 那就是心虚。\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.200, wide from behind 苏小满 (S1), camera on the room's axis looking toward the door: the doorway is now filled with people — clerks, a security guard, two women from the front desk — all crowded into the LEFT doorway, none of them stepping in, none of them speaking.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.400, slow push toward that doorway; a couple of the faces glance at each other and then look away.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.400, hold on the ring of silent onlookers. 苏小满 (S1) stays silent with her mouth closed.",
  "soundscape": "His soft jeering voice, then a swelling of quiet corridor noise as the crowd gathers, shoes shuffling on tile, someone breathing loudly.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t20",
