   "office_pano": "partially_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "Silent beat: she empties her pocket onto the desk one item at a time — keys, then a pen, then a folded paper — and clamps her hand back down on the paper the moment someone leans in to read it.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) stands on the NEAR side of the desk with her back to the door, hand on her pocket; 钱经理 (S3) is one pace in front of her on the NEAR side of the desk; the doorway crowd on the LEFT is watching, mouths shut. The desk surface carries nothing yet — it is a bare dark-topped desktop.\n[Shot 1] Medium: she takes her hand out of her pocket and lays a bunch of keys down on the desk with a small hard click, then sets a ballpoint pen beside it, squared to the desk edge.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, extreme close-up on her hand drawing a single folded paper form halfway out of her pocket and holding it cupped in her palm, still folded.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.600, a man from the doorway puts his head and shoulder into frame from the LEFT and leans in toward her hand; 苏小满 (S1) closes her hand over the folded form and shoves it straight back down into her pocket in one quick movement, and the man straightens up again.\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.600, she puts her hand back into her pocket, forearm sunk to the wrist. Nobody speaks in this whole beat.",
  "soundscape": "Small metallic clinks of keys on wood, a folded paper crackling, the room holding its breath, the crowd at the door shifting weight, the wall clock ticking.",
  "music": "A single thin piano note held very quiet."
 },
