  "summary": "The manager is not satisfied. Her hand goes back into the pocket, and her fingertips meet something hard.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) stands on the near side of the desk, her right forearm buried in her trouser pocket; the keys and the ballpoint pen lie on the desk and the folded paper form is closed inside her pocket; 钱经理 (S3) stands one pace in front of her on the NEAR side of the desk.\n[Shot 1] Close on 钱经理 (S3): he looks down at the two objects on the desk, unimpressed, and says one flat syllable in Mandarin, unhurried: [Chinese] 还有。\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.800, medium: 苏小满 (S1) does not argue. She looks at him, then pushes her hand deeper into the pocket.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, extreme close-up inside the pocket: her fingertips travel past fabric lint and stop on something hard, sharp-cornered and cold.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.000, hold on her fingers closing around it, standing perfectly still. She says nothing and neither does anyone else.",
  "soundscape": "One flat word, then a long held breath; cloth rustling against skin; the dull thud of the crowd's collective breath.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
  "id": "ep01_t22",
