  },
  "summary": "Silent beat: she draws out a black card with a gilt character on it, and the office goes completely quiet.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk, fingers closed on an object deep in her trouser pocket; the keys and the pen lie on the desk; 钱经理 (S3) stands one pace in front of her on the NEAR side of the desk; the crowd packed into the LEFT doorway.\n[Shot 1] Medium: she draws her hand out slowly and holds the object up at chest height, turned three-quarters to the light.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.400, extreme close-up: a matte black card between her thumb and forefinger, with a single gilt character heat-stamped into its face, catching one thin bar of light from the blinds.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.400, wide across the room, held long: nobody moves. 钱经理 (S3) has stopped mid-breath with his mouth slightly open; the crowd in the doorway is frozen; the fluorescent panels whine.\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.000, tight on the round wall clock as its second hand ticks over exactly one second in the still room. Nobody speaks at all in this beat.",
  "soundscape": "Absolute room tone, the ceiling lights' high harmonic, the wall clock's single tick, one person at the door swallowing audibly.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
