  "summary": "He puts his hand out; she gives it up without a word; he turns it over twice and finds a number stamped on the back.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) holds the black card up at chest height on the near side of the desk; 钱经理 (S3) stands one pace in front of her on the NEAR side of the desk; the doorway crowd is still frozen on the LEFT.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) puts his hand out flat, palm up, and says one word in a low commanding Mandarin: [Chinese] 拿来。\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.200, close two hands: she lays the card onto his palm without touching his fingers, then pulls her hand back to her side.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.400, close on his hands as he flips the card over, then over again, angling it toward the window light to read what is on the back.\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, extreme close-up on the back of the card and a single line of tiny stamped characters along its lower edge. Neither of them speaks.\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.400, wide: 钱经理 (S3) turns on his heel and walks back round the end of the desk to his place on the FAR side, back to the window, the card held flat in one hand; 苏小满 (S1) stays where she is and watches him go; nobody else speaks.",
  "soundscape": "One low command, the faint slither of card on skin, his breathing, the crowd's held breath.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
 {
