  "summary": "He reads the name on the back and his hand stops moving; the bullying confidence drains out of his voice into pure suspicion.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) has just reached his place on the FAR side of the desk, back to the window, holding the black card in both hands and tilting it to the light; 苏小满 (S1) stands on the near side of the desk watching him; the doorway crowd on the LEFT.\n[Shot 1] Extreme close-up on the card's lower edge, then on 钱经理's (S3) eyes as he reads it; his thumb stops mid-stroke.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, close on 钱经理 (S3): he lowers the card, looks past it at nothing, and speaks in a low, slow, doubtful Mandarin, his bullying tone entirely gone: [Chinese] 万山的卡？黑的。我在这楼里，头一回见。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.400, reverse onto 苏小满 (S1): she stands absolutely still on the near side of the desk, hands at her sides, watching him read, saying nothing.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.400, hold on her level, unreadable face. Nobody in the room speaks.",
  "soundscape": "A low uncertain voice, the card flexing faintly in his fingers, the fluorescent hum, a chair creaking out in the corridor.",
  "music": "A low unsteady string note under the whole beat."
 },
 {
