  "summary": "The crowd at the door pushes in to look, and the young receptionist asks the question everyone is thinking.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the FAR side of the desk, back to the window, holding the card; 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; the doorway on the LEFT is packed with onlookers.\n[Shot 1] Medium from behind the crowd toward the room: heads and shoulders lean in through the LEFT doorway, several people actually stepping over the threshold now, all of them craning to see the card in his hand.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, 前台 (S12), a young woman in a fitted navy uniform with a silk neck scarf, comes in around the doorframe on the lower-left of frame, half a step ahead of the others, eyes wide, and asks in a bright flustered young Mandarin: [Chinese] 钱经理，这卡……怎么是黑的？\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.400, close on 钱经理 (S3) ignoring her completely and looking only at the woman across the desk.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.000, tight on the black card in his fingers, unreadable. 苏小满 (S1) says nothing.",
  "soundscape": "A young bright voice cutting in, several people trying to speak at once and stopping, shoes and coat fabric crowding through a doorway.",
  "music": "N/A"
 },
