  "summary": "He stops ignoring her and turns the card over as an accusation of its own — a cleaner has no business holding this.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the FAR side of the desk with the card in his hand, 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk facing him, the crowd filling the lower-left of frame behind her.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) pins the card between two fingers and raises it to eye level, turning his body so that both the card and the woman are in his line of sight at once.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, closer on 钱经理 (S3) as he speaks in a cold measured Mandarin, looking her up and down as he does, letting the two phrases fall separately: [Chinese] 你一个保洁。兜里揣这个。\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.200, reverse onto 苏小满 (S1) on the near side of the desk with the card held up beyond it; she meets his eyes and says nothing yet.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.200, hold on the card held up on the FAR side of the desk, catching the blind-light. Nobody else speaks.",
