  "summary": "Short exchange: she says she was given it, and he snaps back for a name.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) holds the card up at eye level on the FAR side of the desk, facing her across it; 苏小满 (S1) stands on the near side of the desk with her back to the door; the crowd is packed into the LEFT doorway behind her.\n[Shot 1] Close on 钱经理 (S3) with the card edge cutting across the lower frame; he fires the question in a short sharp Mandarin: [Chinese] 谁给的。\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.600, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1): she does not take her eyes off him and answers in a perfectly level low Mandarin, no defence in it at all: [Chinese] 别人给我的。\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.400, two-shot across the desk with the raised card between them, his arm still up, her hands still at her sides.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.200, hold on his face, still waiting. Nobody else speaks.",
