 {
  "id": "ep01_t28",
  "scene": "1-2",
  "title": "三天前，有个人",
  "refs": [
   "suxiaoman",
   "qianjingli",
   "office_mid",
   "office_pano"
  ],
  "retention": {
   "office_mid": "partially_preserved",
   "office_pano": "fully_preserved"
  },
  "summary": "She begins to tell it straight, evenly, to a room that has already decided not to believe her.",
  "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) stands on the near side of the desk with her back to the door, facing 钱经理 (S3), who holds the card up on the FAR side of the desk; the crowd fills the LEFT doorway.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) speaks to him and only him, standing straight and still, no gesture at all beyond a small lift of her chin, in a low even Mandarin, letting each clause finish: [Chinese] 三天前。有个人，找到我住的地方。说他姓陆。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.600, wide of the room from behind him: he lowers the card slowly to waist height and stares at her.\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.000, the doorway crowd on the LEFT goes quiet — two of them glance sideways at each other — while 苏小满 (S1) keeps her eyes on the manager and lets the sentence sit.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.800, hold. Nobody else speaks.",
  "soundscape": "Her low clear voice in a room where every voice has dropped, a single cough suppressed at the door, the ceiling lights, the clock.",
  "music": "A quiet suspended string note."
 }
]